{"kind": "mod", "id": 2376, "name": "KappaMarker", "slug": "kappamarker", "teaser": "Marks quests required for Kappa!", "owner_name": "cichaj", "downloads": 9412, "favourites": 15, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.cichaj.km", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Quests", "category_id": 7, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T06:04:42.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-10-18T00:26:48.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-10-18T00:06:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.0", "latest_version": "2.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<h1>KappaMarker</h1>\n<p>A very simple mod that marks quests required for the Collector.<br />\nIt adds “Required for Kappa” to quest descriptions and a “[K]” prefix to quest names.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VX3NUg1.png\" alt=\"Showcase\" /></p>\n<h1>Installation</h1>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the mod.</li>\n<li>⬇️\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"Installation\" /></li>\n</ol>\n<p>Alternatively, you can find the 3.10.5 version on GitHub. I haven’t tested it, but it should work on LTS 3.11 too.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 7037, "downloads": 9412, "published_at": "2025-10-18T00:28:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2376/kappamarker/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "source_code_links": []}